      "text_167550914232333": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
        "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Tour the Amsterdam Skills Centre</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">1. Multipurpose meeting rooms encourage collaborative learning</span></span></p>\n<p>Since its opening in 2019, more than 5,000 healthcare professionals have been trained each year at the Amsterdam Skills Centre. The multipurpose rooms provide a collaborative space for up to 200 healthcare professionals to receive education and share best practices amongst each other.</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jul 06 2022 17:10:06 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
