      "text_167550914232333_1884660371749323331454181": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
        "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">3.</span></span> Diagnostic radiology area offers trainees pre and postoperative feedback</span></span></p>\n<p>The Airo TruCT, featured in the Diagnostic radiology area, gives surgeons the opportunity to perform CT scans. As a result, trainees receive real-time feedback on the surgeries they performed inside the lab. The machine can easily be transported into any lab to offer quick, point-of-care imaging.</p>\n",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Jun 29 2022 19:36:25 GMT+0000",
